# INVWINFB.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the tool bar's
# Find box.  CTRL-F gives it the focus, and a text typed and ENTER find
# the items holding it, titled so, the box keeping the text and the list
# taking the focus; CTRL-F selects the box's text, so a text typed
# replaces it, and ESC or TAB gives the focus back to the list, the
# results and the text kept.  ESC on the results opens the search
# dialog on the text, whose Cancel opens the item list.  ENTER on a box
# of blanks, or empty, and Search > Find text from the box open the
# search dialog.  Logged
# out, every button is grayed and the box disabled and emptied; a
# reader finds too, and a text no item holds gives no rows, where ENTER
# opens nothing.  The end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINFB.SNP is its
# snapshot; TEST/framchk.py checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S ITEMS
K CTRL-F
S BOX
T IBM
S TYPED
K ENTER
S FOUND
K CTRL-F
S AGAIN
T Tandon
S REPLACED
K ESC
S ESCBACK
K CTRL-F TAB
S TABBACK
K CTRL-F ENTER
S FOUND2
K ESC
S DIALOG
K ESC
S LIST
K CTRL-F SPACE SPACE ENTER
S BLANKS
K ESC
S BLANKBK
K CTRL-F BS ENTER
S EMPTY
K ESC
S EMPTYBK
K CTRL-F
T Hercules
K ALT-S T
S F3
K ESC ALT-F L STAB
S LOGOUT
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER
S READER
K CTRL-F
T IBM
K ENTER
S RFOUND
K CTRL-F
T zzz
K ENTER
S NOFIND
K ENTER
S NOENTER
K ALT-F X
